%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant P as Platform API
  participant MWAA as MWAA / Airflow
  participant DDB as DynamoDB<br/>(bgp-task-runs)
  participant D as Downstream<br/>task / workflow
  U->>P: Trigger workflow
  P->>MWAA: dags trigger -r runId
  P->>DDB: record run (running)
  loop Run history (poll)
    P->>MWAA: dags list-runs / tasks states-for-dag-run
    MWAA-->>P: run state + per-node states
    P->>DDB: backfill status + duration
  end
  U->>P: View node logs
  P->>MWAA: InvokeRestApi → task instance logs
  MWAA-->>U: logs
  Note over P,D: On success, exactly-once (downstreamFired guard)
  P->>D: Trigger downstream
